    <string name="capture_screen_notice_body">This capture tool is only for debugging apps you own or are authorized to test.\n\n• Implemented: real tun takeover, userspace TCP relay, UDP passthrough, plaintext HTTP parsing, TLS handshake SNI/ALPN, DNS observations, HAR/JSON export, Repeater replay.\n\n• TLS payload: off by default. With HTTPS decryption on, this device CA signs per-host certificates on the fly for MITM decryption, only for apps you own or are authorized to test, and it never bypasses certificate pinning automatically.\n\n• Data stays on this device and can be cleared at any time.</string>
